    "calculation_formula": {
        "description": "Custom poster printing with square meter-based pricing, material-specific rate tiers, and minimum order handling",
        "steps": [
            "1. Calculate artwork cost: _a = artworks * 5, _a2 = IF _a <= 5 THEN 0 ELSE (_a - 5)",
            "2. Determine dimensions:",
            "   - IF size == 'Custom' THEN use F3 (width) and F7 (length)",
            "   - ELSE use predefined A-series dimensions",
            "   - A2: 420mm x 594mm, A1: 594mm x 841mm, A0: 841mm x 1189mm",
            "3. Calculate total square meters: (width * height / 1,000,000) * quantity",
            "4. Determine rate per sqm based on paper type and total sqm:",
            "   - 250GSM Satin: 51 pricing tiers from $90/sqm (under 1 sqm) to $9.30/sqm (245+ sqm)",
            "   - 200GSM Yuppo: 51 pricing tiers from $90/sqm (under 1 sqm) to $13.63/sqm (245+ sqm)",
            "5. Apply custom size tax: IF size == 'Custom' THEN multiply by 1.1",
            "6. Calculate subtotal: (sqm * rate * custom_tax_rate) + artwork_cost",
            "7. Apply GST: subtotal * 1.1",
            "8. Apply minimum order rule: IF total < $117 THEN total = $117 + $15 ELSE total = total + $15"
        ]
    },
